This file lists the PGP public keys used to sign releases of hec-dss-migrator
published to Maven Central. Verify a downloaded artifact by importing this
file and running `gpg --verify <artifact>.asc <artifact>`.

To append a new key:

    gpg --armor --export <fingerprint> >> KEYS

